### 2. ROUTING: ProtectedRoute + PermissionProtectedRoute PATTERNS

**Master file:** `C:/Users/olive_/OneDrive/Documentos/codigo/Momma/momma-stock-insight/src/App.tsx`

**Pattern A: Admin-only route (like `/admin`, `/tv`, `/funcionarios/analytics`)**
```typescript
<Route
  path="/admin"
  element={
    <PermissionProtectedRoute adminOnly={true}>
      <DashboardLayout>
        <AdminDashboard />
