## Summary for Scaffolding Ouvidoria

**Files to create:**

1. **`src/features/ouvidoria/index.ts`** — Barrel with page exports
2. **`src/features/ouvidoria/types.ts`** — `Complaint`, `Response` types
3. **`src/features/ouvidoria/lib/permissions.ts`** — `useCanViewOuvidoria()`, `useCanRespondOuvidoria()`
4. **`src/features/ouvidoria/model/useOuvidoriaList.ts`** — Query hook
5. **`src/features/ouvidoria/model/useOuvidoriaDetail.ts`** — Detail + responses
6. **`src/features/ouvidoria/ui/Ouvidoria.page.tsx`** — Master list page (owners only)
7. **`src/features/ouvidoria/ui/OuvidoriaDetail.page.tsx`** — View + respond (owners only)
8. **`src/features/ouvidoria/ui/OuvidoriaForm.page.tsx`** — Anonymous form (public)

**Routes to add to `src/App.tsx`:**
```typescript
<Route path="/ouvidoria" element={<PermissionProtectedRoute requiredPermission="view_ouvidoria"><DashboardLayout><OuvidoriaPage /></DashboardLayout></PermissionProtectedRoute>} />
