```

**DB permissions to create:**
- `view_ouvidoria` — Role that can view complaints (assign to owner/admin)
- `manage_ouvidoria` — Role that can respond/close (assign to owner/admin)

This structure mirrors funcionarios, encomendas, and financeiro — battle-tested in your codebase.

